Design a lookup table (LUT) that implements a 2-input XOR function. The module takes a multi-bit input signal, with the parameters specifying the number of input signals and the width of each signal. The LUT is initialized with predefined Boolean values corresponding to the XOR operation for the possible input combinations, allowing it to output the appropriate result based on the input combination.
